Product: WBT-0800 (Silver Solder) or equivalent lead-free silver solder. / 무연 은납 권장.

Reason: Complies with RoHS (<0.1% Lead) and maximizes L6 bonding. / RoHS 준수 및 Layer 6 결합력 극대화.
